        "source_ids": [
          "source-aestimo-a-feedback-directed-optimization-evaluation-tool--e1d344900b12"
        ],
        "text": "The evidence is internally mixed: feedback-directed inlining can deliver meaningful Itanium gains, but bzip2 decision divergence, training-input performance spread, and weak resubstitution ranking show that those gains are not reliably predicted by a single training or evaluation input."
      }
