    "question_id": "question-profile-guided-optimization",
    "schema_version": "question_synthesis_v1",
    "short_answer": "Profile-guided optimization is only moderately reliable across workloads in the linked evidence: feedback-directed inlining can improve performance, especially on Itanium, but training-input choice materially changes compiler decisions and runtime results, so single-input evaluation is unreliable.",
